conv-both: ACCEPT cursor=8
conv-same: ACCEPT cursor=1
conv-differ: REFUSE terms differ at 7
conv-truncated: REFUSE no token at 2
conv-wrong-token: REFUSE step at 0 does not apply
conv-depth: REFUSE depth
infer: REFUSE no token at 7
cycle: ACCEPT cursor=1
cycle-truncated: REFUSE no token at 1
cycle-depth: REFUSE depth
